    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneIV_7.3/p@157535",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LORD.\nGood my liege,\nThe day that she was missing he was here.\nI dare be bound he’s true and shall perform\nAll parts of his subjection loyally. For Cloten,\nThere wants no diligence in seeking him,\nAnd will no doubt be found.",
